    </section>
    <section class="content component usn_cmp_splitcomponent base-bg base-bg-solid  " >  

        <div class="component-inner">
                    <div class="container">


                    <div class="component-main row justify-content-between align-items-center">

                    <div class="item item_block usn_cmp_gallery align-self-center col-xl-5 col-md-6 order-md-1 order-1 col-12   " data-os-animation="fadeIn" data-os-animation-delay="0s" data-os-animation-duration="1.2s">
                        

                                <div class="component-main row  listing  listing_basic-grid listing_gallery" >

                        <div class="item  items-1 col-12  " data-os-animation="fadeIn" data-os-animation-delay="0s" data-os-animation-duration="1.2s">
                        
                            
                                <div class="image  image-opacity-100 image_hover-opacity-40 " >

                                                <picture>
                <source data-srcset="/media/x4mgsueu/meter-read-32.png?width=800&amp;height=530&amp;v=1dc07b9366c8ca0&amp;quality=75&quality=100 1x, /media/x4mgsueu/meter-read-32.png?width=1600&amp;height=1060&amp;v=1dc07b9366c8ca0&amp;quality=75&quality=100 2x" width="800" height="530">
                <img class="lazyload " src="/media/x4mgsueu/meter-read-32.png?width=160&amp;height=106&amp;v=1dc07b9366c8ca0&amp;quality=75" data-src="/media/x4mgsueu/meter-read-32.png?width=800&amp;height=530&amp;v=1dc07b9366c8ca0&amp;quality=75" width="800" height="530" alt="">
            </picture>


                                </div>

                        </div>

        </div>



                        

                    </div>

                    <div class="item item_block usn_cmp_text align-self-center col-xl-7 col-md-6 order-md-2 order-2 col-12   " data-os-animation="fadeIn" data-os-animation-delay="0s" data-os-animation-duration="1.2s">
                        

                            <div class="info text-left">

        <h3 class="heading  base-heading "  data-os-animation="fadeIn" data-os-animation-delay="0s" data-os-animation-duration="1.2s" >Bills based on actual use</h3>        <p class="secondary-heading base-secondary-heading "  data-os-animation="fadeIn" data-os-animation-delay="0s" data-os-animation-duration="1.2s" >Your meter readings matter</p>


        <div class="text base-text " data-os-animation="fadeIn" data-os-animation-delay="0s">
            <p>Submitting regular water meter readings helps ensure your bills are accurate, based on your actual usage, with fewer estimates. <strong>With MyAccount, it’s quick and easy.</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Single or multiple meter readings: </strong>Submitted with just one click.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Photo verification: </strong>Upload a photo of your meter to help us bill you accurately.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Track your history: </strong>View all your previous readings to monitor usage.</p>
</li>
<li>
